Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Prepare native coordinated image precision regressions

Exercise real floating GL upload/copy, source-profile conversion, pool identity and raster tile blending, with normalized storage controls. Register these and the coordinating decoder regression in the existing GTK harness under their normal Skia/LCMS conditions.

Regression sources are prepared but have not been compiled or executed.
